{"seq":4,"slug":"policy-frameworks","title":"政策框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/policy-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paris-agreement","title":"巴黎协定：全球气候治理的里程碑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/policy-frameworks/paris-agreement","wordCount":2553,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-dual-carbon","title":"中国双碳战略：从3060目标到全面绿色转型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/policy-frameworks/china-dual-carbon","wordCount":2630,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"carbon-pricing","title":"碳定价机制：让排放付出经济代价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/policy-frameworks/carbon-pricing","wordCount":3322,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"政策框架\">政策框架</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>本章聚焦全球气候治理的制度设计。从《巴黎协定》的多边框架，到中国&quot;双碳&quot;战略的国家行动，再到碳定价这一核心经济工具，呈现气候政策从目标设定到市场落地的完整链条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>巴黎协定</td>\n<td>NDC机制、全球盘点、1.5°C目标、损失与损害基金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>中国双碳战略</td>\n<td>碳达峰/碳中和、&quot;1+N&quot;政策体系、2026进展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>碳定价机制</td>\n<td>碳税vs碳交易、EU CBAM、中国碳市场、社会碳成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>NDC（国家自主贡献）</strong>：各国自主确定的气候行动承诺</li>\n<li><strong>碳定价（Carbon Pricing）</strong>：通过碳税或碳交易为碳排放赋予经济成本</li>\n<li><strong>CBAM（碳边境调节机制）</strong>：防止&quot;碳泄漏&quot;的贸易政策工具</li>\n</ul>\n"}